{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_015","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Deliver funds from an escrow to the recipient.","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4633,"char_end":4679,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_016","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"{\n\"Account\" : \"rf1BiGeXwwQoi8Z2ueFYTEXSwuJYfV2Jpn\" ,\n\"TransactionType\" : \"EscrowFinish\" ,\n\"Owner\" : \"rf1BiGeXwwQoi8Z2ueFYTEXSwuJYfV2Jpn\" ,\n\"OfferSequence\" : 7 ,\n\"Condition\" : \"A0258020E3B0C44298FC1C149AFBF4C8996FB92427AE41E4649B934CA495991B7852B855810100\" ,\n\"Fulfillment\" : \"A0028000\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4712,"char_end":4998,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_017","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"In addition to the common fields , EscrowFinish transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":5048,"char_end":5134,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_018","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5138,"char_end":5189,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_019","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Owner String - Address AccountID Yes The source account that funded the escrow.","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5193,"char_end":5272,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_020","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"OfferSequence Number UInt32 Yes Transaction sequence of EscrowCreate transaction that created the escrow to finish.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5274,"char_end":5389,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_021","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Condition String - Hexadecimal Blob No The (previously-supplied) PREIMAGE-SHA-256 crypto-condition of the escrow.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5391,"char_end":5504,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_022","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"CredentialIDs Array of Strings Vector256 No Set of Credentials to authorize a deposit made by this transaction. Each member of the array must be the ledger entry ID of a Credential entry in the ledger. For details, see Credential IDs .","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5506,"char_end":5741,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_023","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Fulfillment String - Hexadecmial Blob No The PREIMAGE-SHA-256 crypto-condition fulfillment matching the escrow&#x27;s Condition .","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":5743,"char_end":5872,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_024","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Any account may submit an EscrowFinish transaction.","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":5876,"char_end":5927,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_025","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"If the escrow has a FinishAfter time, you cannot execute it before this time. Specifically, if the corresponding EscrowCreate transaction specified a FinishAfter time that is after the close time of the most recently-closed ledger, the EscrowFinish transaction fails.","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5931,"char_end":6198,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_026","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"If the escrow has a Condition , you cannot execute it unless you provide a matching Fulfillment for the condition.","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":6200,"char_end":6314,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_027","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"You cannot execute an escrow after it has expired. Specifically, if the corresponding EscrowCreate transaction specified a CancelAfter time that is before the close time of the most recently-closed ledger, the EscrowFinish transaction fails.","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6316,"char_end":6557,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_028","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"The minimum transaction cost to submit an EscrowFinish transaction increases if it contains a fulfillment. If the transaction has no fulfillment, the transaction cost is the standard ledger base fee, typically 10 drops. If the transaction contains a fulfillment, the transaction cost is 330 drops of XRP plus another 10 drops for every 16 bytes in size of the preimage. Should the validators vote to increase or lower the base fee, the cost per 16 bytes is adjusted accordingly.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6569,"char_end":7047,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_029","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"In non-production networks , it may be possible to delete the destination account of a pending escrow. In this case, an attempt to finish the escrow fails with the result tecNO_TARGET , but the escrow object remains unless it has expired normally. If another payment re-creates the destination account, the escrow can be finished successfully. The destination account of an escrow can only be deleted if the escrow was created before the fix1523 amendment became enabled. No such escrows exist in the production XRP Ledger, so this edge case is not possible on the production XRP Ledger. This edge case is also not possible in test networks that enable both fix1523 and Escrow amendments at the same time, which is the default when you start a new genesis ledger .","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":7049,"char_end":7813,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_030","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, EscrowFinish transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":7828,"char_end":7960,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_031","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"tecNO_AUTH The transaction failed because authorization requirements were not met. For example, the issuer requires authorization and the destination is not authorized.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7990,"char_end":8158,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_032","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"tecNO_LINE The destination account does not have a trust line with the issuer. For Trust Line Tokens only.","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":8160,"char_end":8266,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_033","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"tecNO_ENTRY The destination account does not hold the MPT.","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":8268,"char_end":8326,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_034","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"tecINSUFFICIENT_RESERVE Unable to create a trust line or MPToken due to lack of reserves.","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":8328,"char_end":8417,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e1cfbbad4fa5_035","source_id":"src_e1cfbbad4fa5","source_hash":"83aa3fe9a5e4d0ec49a8710530df54914d7dc0f2a4b17f3c27fa1194669f509a","text":"tecFROZEN The token is deep frozen (Trust Line Tokens) or locked (for MPTs).","location_hint":"paragraph 253","char_start":8419,"char_end":8495,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:24:17.940Z"}
